#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:276
msgid "Using SITL with legacy versions of Gazebo"
msgstr "将 SITL 与旧版本的 Gazebo 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:5 128ecda59427419090cc302e6b032a29
msgid "Using SITL with Gazebo"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 Gazebo 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:7 6cc14d3b1f0947c992052c533593b1d2
msgid ""
"`Gazebo <http://gazebosim.org/>`__ is a well known and respected robotics"
" simulator which has been used in a number of robotics simulation "
"challenges for ground, marine and space based robots, including the DARPA"
" Robotics Challenge, DARPA Subterranean Challenge and Virtual RobotX "
"Competition."
msgstr ""
"`Gazebo <http://gazebosim.org/>`__ "
"是一款知名且受人尊重的机器人仿真器，已被用于多项机器人仿真挑战，涵盖地面、海洋和太空机器人，包括 DARPA 机器人挑战赛、DARPA "
"地下挑战赛和虚拟 RobotX 竞赛。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:12 94ae757f0080420aab71ffc5a145f327
msgid ""
"There are two main generations of Gazebo. To use SITL with Gazebo11 and "
"earlier versions see the :ref:`instructions for legacy versions <sitl-"
"with-gazebo-legacy>`."
msgstr ""
"Gazebo 主要分为两代。要将 SITL 与 Gazebo11 及更早版本配合使用，请参阅 :ref:`旧版本说明 <sitl-with-"
"gazebo-legacy>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:16 26df82395f3544f5887ebbf1d2c8a981
msgid ""
"This article explains how to use the latest generation of Gazebo as an "
"external simulator for ArduPilot Rover, Coper and Plane."
msgstr "本文介绍如何将最新一代 Gazebo 用作 ArduPilot Rover、Copter 和 Plane 的外部仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:23 f24d79eebca84840865a151bb3b5c89f
msgid ""
"Gazebo is particularly useful for defining autonomous indoor flights, "
"swarms, non-flying vehicle types such as rovers and boats, and multi-"
"vehicle scenarios such as the ship landing simulation in the video above."
msgstr "Gazebo 特别适用于定义自主室内飞行、集群任务、Rover 和船等非飞行飞行器类型，以及上述视频中舰船降落仿真等多飞行器场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:30 d7cd4e17ec464e3d9f62432e8117a2e2
msgid "Install ArduPilot SITL"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:32 16737119bb104bbd8381a97b5e583bc4
msgid ""
"Ensure that you have an ArduPilot development environment set up, "
"including MAVProxy as a GCS. Verify that you can run SITL examples for "
"Copter and Plane. The `ArduPilot Development wiki "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/index.html>`__ has all the information "
"required."
msgstr ""
"确保已设置 ArduPilot 开发环境，包括作为地面控制站的 MAVProxy。验证可以运行 Copter 和 Plane 的 SITL "
"示例。`ArduPilot 开发 wiki <https://ardupilot.org/dev/index.html>`__ 包含所有所需信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:40 e442938602874f3eb45b6043134c6b70
msgid "Install Gazebo"
msgstr "安装 Gazebo"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:42 60769b442f494d3f8c88ff3b410872f1
msgid ""
"We currently support `Gazebo Garden "
"<https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/install>`__ and `Gazebo Harmonic "
"<https://gazebosim.org/docs/harmonic/install>`__ which are available for "
"Ubuntu 20.04 (Focal) and 22.04 (Jammy) and macOS Big Sur (11), Monterey "
"(12), and Ventura (13)."
msgstr ""
"目前支持 `Gazebo Garden <https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/install>`__ 和 "
"`Gazebo Harmonic <https://gazebosim.org/docs/harmonic/install>`__，适用于 "
"Ubuntu 20.04（Focal）和 22.04（Jammy）以及 macOS Big Sur（11）、Monterey（12）和 "
"Ventura（13）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:49 4c89de2510384dc899651a97035ecfa3
msgid "Install Gazebo following the instructions for your platform."
msgstr "按照您平台的说明安装 Gazebo。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:51 a3513a1e823c46d6b644d035f78976a4
msgid "Check that the Gazebo installation is working:"
msgstr "验证 Gazebo 安装是否正常工作："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:57 fbbdad6da6b844ef85e5c23ed799f46a
msgid ""
"This should open a world containing a variety of shapes (on macOS you "
"will need to run the Gazebo server and client in separate terminals)."
msgstr "这应该会打开一个包含各种形状的世界（在 macOS 上需要在单独的终端中分别运行 Gazebo 服务器和客户端）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:62 dfbf2cdd6ff44ef1993cfe29bfb9aa43
msgid "Install the ArduPilot Gazebo Plugin"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot Gazebo 插件"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:64 47ad8f90143c47729fc2ac19eec324f8
msgid ""
"These instructions can also be found in the `ardupilot_gazebo/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo/blob/main/README.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"这些说明也可以在 `ardupilot_gazebo/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo/blob/main/README.md>`__ "
"中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:66 b7e69bf1d11c42a7b6a213d2dab4cc34
msgid ""
"We use a standard version of ArduPilot with a custom plugin for Gazebo "
"which is hosted on GitHub at: "
"`https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo>`__."
msgstr ""
"我们使用标准版 ArduPilot 和托管在 GitHub 上的 Gazebo "
"自定义插件：`https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:71 c66f95a64edf4870a804cebd285c8337
msgid ""
"While Gazebo is commonly used with ROS / ROS2, the ArduPilot Gazebo "
"plugin does not depend on ROS."
msgstr "虽然 Gazebo 通常与 ROS/ROS2 配合使用，但 ArduPilot Gazebo 插件不依赖于 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:77 b0a28378d062488abc364fc4f0c38ccc
msgid ""
"The original version of the plugin located at "
"`https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ is compatible with the "
"`legacy versions of Gazebo <https://classic.gazebosim.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"位于 `https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ 的原始版本插件与 `旧版 Gazebo "
"<https://classic.gazebosim.org/>`__ 兼容。"

